    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Shane",
      "key": "eventSeen_611944_memory_oneweek",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Have you tried the new Joja Bubblerito? I ate two in one sitting yesterday, that was a mistake...",
      "translation": "Máš už ochutnané nové Joja Bubblerito? Včera jsem snědl dvě najednou. Byla to chyba...",
